---
// HeroSection.astro - Cinematic futuristic hero
---

<section class="relative z-10 pt-12 pb-8 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
  <!-- Eyebrow Tag -->
  <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] border border-[#16E6F5]/30 backdrop-blur-md mb-6 shadow-cyan-glow-sm">
    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#16E6F5] animate-pulse"></span>
    <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest text-[#50F5FF] uppercase font-semibold">
      Personal Travel Intelligence
    </span>
  </div>

  <!-- Primary Headline -->
  <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-sans font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-[1.1]">
    Where will you <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
    <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-[#16E6F5] to-[#6C7CFF] bg-clip-text text-transparent">
      go next?
    </span>
  </h1>

  <!-- Supporting Body -->
  <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#91A1B3] max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 font-normal leading-relaxed">
    Tell TripMesh where you want to go, what you want to experience, and how much you want to spend. Your autonomous AI travel concierge synchronizes flights, stays, and experiences around you.
  </p>

  <!-- Capability Badges -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-[#91A1B3]">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08]">
      <span class="text-[#16E6F5]">✦</span>
      <span>Autonomous Agent Mesh</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08]">
      <span class="text-[#6C7CFF]">◈</span>
      <span>Live Multi-Currency Sync</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08]">
      <span class="text-[#50F5FF]">⟡</span>
      <span>Instant Re-budgeting</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
